  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Centre for Technology (ICfT)/ Tech CoE helpdesk pilots</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICfT Helpdesk Pilots to be initiated in the remainder of the 2025/26 FY will enable Posts in Africa to leverage and connect tech expertise from the UK with local actors and priorities to strengthen and build modern development partnerships. In the 2026/27 FY the Helpdesk will build on these pilot initiatives and serve as FCDO&#x2019;s gateway for accessing UK technical assistance, expertise and thought leadership on technology from across government, the private sector and academia. It will also draw on research, evidence and technology investments in the R&amp;D portfolio.</narrative>
  </description>
